# Line-ending policy for Beautiful Noise.
#
# The repository stores all text as LF, and because the app deploys to Linux
# (Streamlit Community Cloud), we also check out LF in the working tree — even
# on Windows. Pinning eol=lf means Git never converts CRLF<->LF, which keeps
# line endings consistent and silences the "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit rules for the text types in this repo (belt and braces).
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never apply line-ending conversion (defensive; none tracked yet).
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.ico   binary
